position at a university in Switzerland. I later moved around, teaching

47
00:05:19.001 --> 00:05:27.166
at other universities throughout Europe. Eventually I had a very distinguished professorship at the University of Berlin, but

48
00:05:27.167 --> 00:05:34.709
once again I left Germany. In 1933, while my wife and I were visiting the United States, Hitler came

49
00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:44.063
to power in Germany. Jews were no longer allowed to teach. Our home was taken by the government, and a bounty was put

50
00:05:44.064 --> 00:05:51.289
on my head. We settled in the U.S., and I began to work at the Institute for Advanced Study at

51
00:05:51.290 --> 00:06:01.464
Princeton University. FAYE MOSS: In 1939 you drafted a letter to American president Franklin Roosevelt warning him that Germany was working on

52
00:06:01.465 --> 00:06:07.056
