54
00:06:14.347 --> 00:06:20.417
from using theirs. Had I known Germany would not complete theirs, I might not have

55
00:06:20.418 --> 00:06:30.912
signed that letter. As a lifelong pacifist, I regretted my part. Signing the letter was the one great mistake of

56
00:06:30.913 --> 00:06:36.541
my life. After the war I worked to stop the building of nuclear weapons and promote

57
00:06:36.542 --> 00:06:42.689
peace. I also helped raise money for Jewish causes and worked for racial equality in my new country.

58
00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:50.058
As a Jew, I felt I could understand how African American people felt when they were treated unfairly. FAYE

59
